    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE EARTH NEEDS YOUR HELP!</strong><br><br><i>Planet Keeper Program</i> is a program created by the government to prepare humans against different levels of threat. Help us create the best defense!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With different levels, enemies and dangerous bosses, you need to spend your resources in the best way to improve your powerful laser.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAMEPLAY:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeat... many times!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+40 upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music to vibe with</p></li></ul>",
